### GET /api/products — functional (port 3000)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products

###

### GET /api/products z filtrami — functional
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products?category_id=1&search=laptop&page=1&limit=10

###

### GET /api/products — OOP (port 3001)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products

###

### GET /api/products z filtrami — OOP
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products?category_id=1&search=laptop&page=1&limit=10

###

### GET /api/products/:id — functional
GET http://localhost:3000/api/products/1

###

### GET /api/products/:id — OOP
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products/1

###

### POST /api/products — functional (wymaga JWT)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "description": "High-performance laptop",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stock": 50,
  "categoryId": 1
}

###

### POST /api/products bez kategorii — functional
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Generic Item",
  "price": 9.99,
  "stock": 100
}

###

### POST /api/products — OOP (wymaga JWT)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Laptop Pro",
  "description": "High-performance laptop",
  "price": 1299.99,
  "stock": 50,
  "categoryId": 1
}
